# hair/adult/longwavy_hang: Long wavy's hanging ends: wavy locks on the shoulders in front, a wavy mass to mid-back behind; they
# lag the step (hair keys) and sway with the hips (sway); pressed flat under a lying head (lie: none)
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair longwavy
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys hair
sway 2
z 1

